  {
    "hotel_id": "517713",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/orange-hotel/hotel/da-nang-vn.html",
    "name": "Orange City Center Hotel Da Nang - Near Han Market & Dragon Brigde",
    "detail": "When you bear in mind there are resort hotels in Da Nang charging up to $1,000 per night this seemed incredible when we secured a room for $50. How could they compete? Well, they DO! Price does not reflect in the quality and service what-so-ever and this hotel's got everything. We were lucky enough to meet the whole family and heard stories of inspiration from the father who started his career as a motor-cycle repair shop and worked every hour available to build up his empire. His son works his socks off to make sure everyone is beyond happy. It simply is remarkable, inspirational and exceptional. Don't hesitate. You'll love it.",
